{"id":7603,"date":"2024-11-26T16:46:39","date_gmt":"2024-11-26T09:46:39","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/?p=7603"},"modified":"2024-12-25T08:42:44","modified_gmt":"2024-12-25T01:42:44","slug":"simulasi-tanggap-darurat-pt-telkom-landmark-tower","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/2024\/11\/simulasi-tanggap-darurat-pt-telkom-landmark-tower\/","title":{"rendered":"Simulasi Tanggap Darurat PT Telkom Landmark Tower"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"7603\" class=\"elementor elementor-7603\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-7e4a94b elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default astroon-bg-container\" data-id=\"7e4a94b\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-7cda13c\" data-id=\"7cda13c\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-59eeec5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"59eeec5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.16.0 - 09-10-2023 *\/\n.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-stacked .elementor-drop-cap{background-color:#69727d;color:#fff}.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-framed .elementor-drop-cap{color:#69727d;border:3px solid;background-color:transparent}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap{margin-top:8px}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap-letter{width:1em;height:1em}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap{float:left;text-align:center;line-height:1;font-size:50px}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap-letter{display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t<h4><span style=\"font-weight: 500;\">Simulasi Tanggap Darurat PT Telkom Landmark Tower<\/span><\/h4><p>\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-95e5cc9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"95e5cc9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Pada Sabtu, 23 November 2024, PT Telkom Landmark Tower yang berlokasi di Jl. Jendral Gatot Subroto Kav. 52, Jakarta Selatan, melaksanakan simulasi Tanggap Darurat yang melibatkan seluruh tenant, dan tim terkait. Agenda rutin yang dilakukan PT Telkom Landmark Tower ini merupakan salah satu bentuk peningkatan layanan guna memberikan rasa aman dan nyaman dalam bekerja di lingkungan The Telkom Hub<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fc2ea43 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"fc2ea43\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tanggap Darurat dalam Meningkatkan Kesiapsiagaan<\/span><\/h4><p>\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cdc3bfd elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"cdc3bfd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.16.0 - 09-10-2023 *\/\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"336\" src=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/3-1024x538.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-7612\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/3-1024x538.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/3-300x158.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/3-768x404.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/3-1536x807.jpeg 1536w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/3.jpeg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4e3d556 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4e3d556\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Rangkaian kegiatan ini merupakan bagian dari langkah preventif yang dilakukan PT Telkom Landmark Tower guna menghadapi situasi darurat. Kegiatan diawali dengan\u00a0 apel bersama di Auditorium Lantai 6 dipimpin langsung oleh GM Property Management Bapak Sigit Hermanto dan dihadiri oleh Direktur Operasi PT Telkom Landmark Tower Bapak Ferry Alfonso, Bapak Bayu Aji Wijaya selaku Direktur KMRA PT Telkom Landmark Tower, dan Bapak Eko Sutanto Sebagai AVP Security and Safety PT Telekomunikasi Indonesia.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-18e34d6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"18e34d6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/10-1024x576.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-7605\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/10-1024x576.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/10-300x169.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/10-768x432.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/10.jpeg 1160w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-311afe5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"311afe5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Simulasi Kali ini dimulai dengan skenario terjadinya gempa di Gedung Telkom Landmark Tower Pukul 10.00 WIB, pada saat seluruh tenant yang sedang bekerja di dalam ruangan terjadi gempa bumi dengan kekuatan yang cukup besar. Alarm peringatan bahaya yang telah berbunyi di dalam gedung memberikan informasi\u00a0 untuk segera melakukan perlindungan terhadap diri sesuai dengan prosedur penangananan gempa.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2a90213 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"2a90213\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/9-1024x576.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-7606\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/9-1024x576.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/9-300x169.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/9-768x432.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/9.jpeg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dd4a886 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"dd4a886\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Setelah terjadinya gempa, seluruh tenant diberikan instruksi yang dipimpin oleh masing-masing floor warden untuk keluar gedung melalui tangga darurat dengan tenang dan tetap melindungi kepala menggunakan tangan agar meminimalisir cidera apabila terkena reruntuhan benda keras yang dapat membahayakan.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b2173fc elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"b2173fc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"356\" src=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/6-1024x570.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-7609\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/6-1024x570.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/6-300x167.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/6-768x428.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/6-1536x855.jpeg 1536w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/6.jpeg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8e9f451 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8e9f451\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Skenario Selanjutnya adalah munculnya percikan api dilantai tiga yang disebabkan oleh kebocoran gas dari salah satu ruangan akibat guncangan gempa sehingga memicu kobaran api yang besar disertai dengan asap hitam pekat memenuhi lantai tersebut. Dengan penanganan\u00a0 dan perlengkapan\u00a0 memadai yang dimiliki PT Telkom Landmark Tower, tim security yang berada di area tersebut dengan sigap melakukan penanganan. Mereka mengenakan masker untuk melindungi diri dari asap pekat, kemudian menggunakan APAR (Alat Pemadam Api Ringan) dan Hydrant gedung untuk memadamkan api, sementara tim lain segera menghubungi pemadam kebakaran dan ambulans Yakes Telkom untuk penanganan pertama apabila terjadi korban.<\/span><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-733bb91 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"733bb91\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"351\" src=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/7.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-7608\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/7.jpeg 828w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/7-300x164.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/7-768x421.jpeg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-baf3428 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"baf3428\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Dengan koordinasi dan kerja sama yang baik antara tim pemadam internal dengan Gulkarmar DKI proses pemadaman titik kobaran api dapat dipercepat. Namun, pada saat yang bersamaan, personel ambulans Yakes menerima informasi dari tim keamanan bahwa terdapat salah satu korban yang terjebak di dalam Gedung Telkom Landmark Tower. Personel Yakes membutuhkan tandu karena korban terkena reruntuhan akibat gempa. Dengan sigap, personel ambulans Yakes bergegas ke lokasi tempat korban mengalami cidera.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8312200 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"8312200\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" src=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/4-1024x768.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-7611\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/4-1024x768.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/4-300x225.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/4-768x576.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/4.jpeg 1170w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9978f2f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9978f2f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Proses evakuasi dilakukan dengan cepat dan profesional oleh personel dari unit Yakes terhadap seorang korban yang tertimpa reruntuhan. Korban mengalami pendarahan ringan di area kepala, yang mengakibatkan kehilangan keseimbangan menyebabkan tidak mampu berjalan. <br><\/span><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-511fcf9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"511fcf9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"418\" src=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/5-1024x669.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-7610\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/5-1024x669.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/5-300x196.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/5-768x502.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/5-1536x1003.jpeg 1536w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/5.jpeg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d57ba3f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d57ba3f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Berkat kesigapan tim, korban berhasil dievakuasi menuju Lobby Gedung Telkom Landmark Tower dan segera dipindahkan ke ambulans, kemudian dibawa ke rumah sakit terdekat guna mendapat penanganan medis lebih lanjut.<br \/><\/span><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6394690 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"6394690\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/1-1024x576.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-7614\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/1-1024x576.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/1-300x169.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/1-768x432.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/1.jpeg 1160w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1086334 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1086334\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Seluruh tenant yang berada di Gedung\u00a0 Telkom Landmark Tower kemudian diarahkan\u00a0 menuju titik assembling point sesuai arahan floor warden. \u00a0<br \/>Untuk meredam situasi\u00a0 panik yang dialami tenant di kawasan The Telkom Hub menjalani pemeriksaan ringan yang dilakukan tim\u00a0 P3K pada saat terjadinya bencana. <br \/><\/span><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1e3bf15 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"1e3bf15\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"426\" src=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/2-1024x682.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-7613\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/2-1024x682.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/2-300x200.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/2-768x512.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/2-1536x1023.jpeg 1536w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/2.jpeg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dddb78e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"dddb78e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Simulasi Tanggap Darurat ini memberikan gambaran nyata mengenai kondisi dan kesiapsiagaan seluruh tim tanggap darurat dalam mengatasi bencana yang dapat terjadi secara bersamaan.<br>Diharapkan, dengan adanya agenda rutin pelaksanaan simulasi tanggap darurat ini dapat menjadi salah satu bentuk evaluasi yang menyeluruh serta upaya untuk meningkatkan kesadaran dan kewaspadaan seluruh tenant dan tim terkait di lingkungan The Telkom Hub.<br><\/span><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-8c8ed52 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default astroon-bg-container\" data-id=\"8c8ed52\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-7123860\" data-id=\"7123860\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-c912fe3 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default astroon-bg-container\" data-id=\"c912fe3\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-87a9e13\" data-id=\"87a9e13\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Simulasi Tanggap Darurat PT Telkom Landmark Tower \u00a0 Pada Sabtu, 23 November 2024, PT Telkom Landmark Tower yang berlokasi di Jl. Jendral Gatot Subroto Kav. 52, Jakarta Selatan, melaksanakan simulasi Tanggap Darurat yang melibatkan seluruh tenant, dan tim terkait. Agenda rutin yang dilakukan PT Telkom&#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":7626,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_eb_attr":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"aioseo_notices":[],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7603"}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=7603"}],"version-history":[{"count":30,"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7603\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":7654,"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7603\/revisions\/7654"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/7626"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=7603"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","em